# Form wizard files

Read `docs/form-wizard/architecture.md` and `docs/form-wizard/TASKS.md` first. Then `.cursor/skills/omr-form-wizard/SKILL.md`.

- Own only the files listed for your agent in TASKS.md.
- Save `TemplatePayload`. Do not re-detect circles at scan time.
- Detect is `action: detect_circles` on the existing `api/omr.py` function.
- Shell vs Konva: 21st.dev prompts restyle `FormWizard` chrome only.
- Do not edit root `CLAUDE.md` / `AGENTS.md`.
- Do not `git push` unless the user asked.
